        "slc_2cf56716c3216aad4c0aca70aa5e3270023307829dde499b1865b6b292d36568",
        "slc_428d22b6c9d023babb6da161a694ab5be620a2cae729ddb9962c0478dc405849"
      ],
      "text": "TrueForge is an open-source agent harness that runs the agent execution loop (model calls, MCP tools, skills, sandboxing, approvals, context management, session state) and exposes it as a chat UI, an HTTP API with a TypeScript SDK, and an embeddable UI SDK."
    },
