      ],
      "text": "The UI SDK offers three levels of control: using the TrueForgeUI component directly, supplying a custom layout, or mounting providers manually; it exports runtime-connected containers (ThreadContainer, ComposerContainer, ThreadListContainer) and presentational atoms replaceable via an overrides mechanism."
    },
