        "slc_0753c91a3a85d6ddf56f0802ac90462a4af260be158bbf635a14fc25f0f28e0b"
      ],
      "text": "The UI SDK exposes stable styling hooks (.aui-root, .aui-markdown, .aui-monaco, data-slot attributes), though some slot values like avatar and tool-call-card lack the aui_ prefix, so users should inspect elements rather than assume the prefix."
    },
